        "description": "One row per quote in each provider's latest daily snapshot: provider, market (`ondemand`, `spot` = interruptible, `bid` = marketplace minimum bid, `secure`/`community` = RunPod tiers), GPUs in the quoted unit, USD per GPU-hour, quoted unit price, region where the provider exposes one, and provider-specific detail in `extra` (marketplace host reliability, VRAM, stock status). Sources are each provider's public price feed or page (Vast.ai: the cheapest 64 offers per model, on-demand and bid); /gpu/models lists who quotes each model. Snapshots are taken several times a day.",
